  "name": "DR — 05 Weekly Report & Token Health",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Monday morning report\n\nPulls last week's numbers from all three networks plus the CRM, has Claude write a short readout, and emails it.\n\n### The part that is not cosmetic\n\nThe **token health check** runs in the same pass. Facebook page tokens expire, and the failure mode is silent — posts stop going out and nobody notices for a fortnight. If the token has under 14 days left, the report says so in the subject line.\n\nUse a Business Manager **System User** token to avoid the 60-day expiry entirely; this check is the backstop either way.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -20
      ]
    },
